1. Removed the artificial "crafting_table → rename pickaxe" edge
2. Reversed the relationship between mining slab and renaming — now mining comes before renaming
3. Created a branching structure from mine spruce_log (one branch to crafting, one to mining slab)
4. Made "rename pickaxe" the final capstone task
5. Acknowledged that only the first edge (spruce_log → crafting_table) is a genuinely hard mechanical dependency

